# Enter a cave facing north (Ravaged Path from Route 204): the recorded exit is one tile south of the
# entrance (Field_SetMapConnection), the tile the player stood on. USE a Rope from the bag and arrive there.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 40
give item platinum:ITEM_ESCAPE_ROPE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_204_SOUTH 171 706 up
+0 wild flee
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_RAVAGED_PATH"
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 tap pocket:0
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
until app none
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_204_SOUTH 171 706
+0 assert state player.facing "up"
+0 assert state bag.items.length 0
